# Claude Code Project Rules for SwiFT-IO
# This file configures automatic permissions and behaviors for Claude Code

## Automatic Tool Permissions

### Git Operations (Always Allowed)
# Allow all git operations without asking
- git status
- git diff
- git log
- git add (any files in src/, docs/, igmap/)
- git commit (with proper commit messages)
- git push (to current branch)

### SLURM Operations (Always Allowed)
# Job management
- sbatch (submit jobs)
- squeue (check job status)
- scancel (cancel jobs)
- scontrol (job control)

### File Operations in Project Directory
# Allow read/write in these directories without asking
- Read any files in: src/, docs/, igmap/, sample_scripts/, logs/
- Write/Edit files in: src/, docs/, igmap/
- Create new files in: src/module/utils/, docs/analysis/, sample_scripts/

### Python/Conda Operations (Always Allowed)
- python -c (quick tests)
- python -m (module execution)
- conda activate/deactivate
- pip install (with confirmation for non-dev packages)

### Log/Output Monitoring (Always Allowed)
- tail (log files)
- cat (log files)
- grep (searching logs)
- ls (listing directories)

## Restricted Operations (Always Ask)
# These operations require explicit user confirmation
- rm -rf (recursive deletion)
- chmod/chown (permission changes on system files)
- sudo (any sudo command)
- git push --force
- Modifying files outside project directory

## Experiment Tracking
# Automatically add these tags to wandb runs
- loss_type (regression_loss_type value)
- sequence_length (seq{N})
- experiment_name

## Code Style Preferences
- Use type hints in Python
- Add docstrings for new functions/classes
- Keep commit messages clear and descriptive
- Use descriptive variable names (no single letters except i,j,k in loops)

## Development Workflow
1. Always read files before editing
2. Run quick tests after major changes
3. Commit working code frequently
4. Use meaningful branch names
5. Add inline comments for complex logic

## Project-Specific Notes
- Default node: node3 (node1 has issues)
- Default epochs: 30 (for quick experiments)
- Main branch: main
- Current dev branch: kimbo-labserver-swiftv9
- WandB project: moviefmri

